; The Loop IR: a naive, structured loop program lowered from a validated
; [Fusion_plan.t], its reference interpreter, and the JavaScript emitter. See
; the Loop IR sections of the kernel-DSL design doc in .ai/.
;
; Depends on [native] (Kernel, Fusion_plan, Tensor), never the reverse: [native]
; stays unaware that a second executor exists, and its jsoo mirror list is
; unchanged. Wrapped (default), so consumers see [Loop_ir.Loop_expr] and no
; global name collides with [native]'s flat (wrapped false) namespace.

(library
 (name loop_ir)
 (libraries core err_trace expr fmt native))
